    Elite hit is exactly 2/3. Damage and rewards remain tied to spawn. Moderate pacing:
    85-95% purchase milestones on a single clear; boss reward about 2-3 upgrades.
    Combo HP budget 45%. Flame Golem is a lighter single-phase boss. No gate on boss
    access. Necromancer summons grant no currency.'
